OL,3,GNEWSAWoman aged 104 enjoys 130mph
OL,4,ABrands Hatch ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman aged 104 has enjoyed a ride
OL,7,Faround Brands Hatch racing circuit in
OL,8,FKent, reaching speeds of up to 130mph
OL,9,Fin an electric sports car.
OL,11,FKathleen Woolmer, who lives at Wombwell
OL,12,FHall Care Home, Northfleet, took to the
OL,13,Ftrack as a passenger in a fully
OL,14,Felectric Hyundai at the famous motor
OL,15,Fracing venue.
OL,17,FThe former motorbike enthusiast said
OL,18,Fthe experience was "super" and
OL,19,F"exciting".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
