OL,3,GNEWSAWoman aged 104 enjoys 130mph
OL,4,ABrands Hatch ride
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I used to like this on a motorbike,"
OL,7,Fshe said after the high-speed lap.
OL,8,F"It's super. It's exciting. I squealed.
OL,9,FOh, it was great. I enjoyed every
OL,10,Fmoment of it."
